    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><br><br>On Tuesday, July 31, 2012 10:43:52 AM UTC-7, Souvik Banerjee wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Here it goes.<br><br>&gt; hb.new.table(&quot;testmatrix&quot;, &quot;name&quot;, &quot;value&quot;);</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">[1] TRUE</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">&gt; mata &lt;- matrix(data = 1, nrow = 10, ncol = 6, byrow = FALSE, dimnames = NULL);</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">&gt; mata</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">      [,1] [,2] [,3] [,4] [,5] [,6]</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"> [1,]    1    1    1    1    1    1</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"> [2,]    1    1    1    1    1    1</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"> [3,]    1    1    1    1    1    1</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"> [4,]    1    1    1    1    1    1</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"> [5,]    1    1    1    1    1    1</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"> [6,]    1    1    1    1    1    1</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"> [7,]    1    1    1    1    1    1</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"> [8,]    1    1    1    1    1    1</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"> [9,]    1    1    1    1    1    1</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">[10,]    1    1    1    1    1    1</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">&gt; hb.insert(&quot;testmatrix&quot;, list(1, c(&quot;name&quot;, &quot;value&quot;), list(&quot;mata&quot;, mata)))</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Error in row[[2]] : subscript out of bounds</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Thanks and regards,</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Souvik.</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br>On Tuesday, 31 July 2012 04:27:57 UTC+5:30, Antonio Piccolboni  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Did you try?<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Jul 30, 2012 at 3:36 PM, Souvik Banerjee wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Hi,</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Can I use hb.insert to insert a matrix in HBase? Is there anything that needs to be taken care of while inserting the matrix?</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">\r\n<br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Thanks and regards,</span><br style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Souvik.</span><span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>